exports[`RepResult section="all", the Log's page (#427) > and a stored recording that could not be scored, likewise, with no star text 1`] = `"<link rel="preload" as="image" href="/demos-512/demos-onboard-speaking.webp"/><div class="mt-5"><h2 class="font-display text-title ">Not enough to score</h2><p class="mt-2 text-body text-stone-500 text-pretty">12 words isn&#x27;t enough yet. Give it 60 to 90 seconds and a real answer.</p></div><div class="mt-7 flex w-full items-start gap-3 text-left"><div class="relative shrink-0"><div class="relative mx-auto shrink-0  " style="width:112px;height:112px" aria-hidden="true"><div class="relative z-[1] h-full w-full "><div class="relative h-full w-full"><img alt="" width="112" height="112" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="demos demos-breath  block h-full w-full" style="color:transparent" src="/demos-512/demos-onboard-speaking.webp"/><svg viewBox="0 0 40 60" class="absolute text-amber" style="left:82%;top:14%;width:12%;height:17%" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"><path class="arc" style="--i:0" d="M 6 18 q 8 12 0 24"></path><path class="arc" style="--i:1" d="M 16 12 q 11 18 0 36"></path><path class="arc" style="--i:2" d="M 26 6 q 14 24 0 48"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 "><div data-speech="" class="relative px-4 py-3.5 font-body font-normal card text-ink text-detail leading-[24px] "><p class="text-balance">Give it 60 to 90 seconds and a real answer.</p><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute h-3.5 w-3.5 rotate-45 border-card-edge bg-raised -left-[7px] top-[22px] border-b border-l dark:bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--color-raised),#fff_2%)]"></span></div></div></div><section class="mt-7"><h2 class="section-head">Your scores</h2><div class="mt-3"><div class="card px-4 py-1"><details class="border-b border-hairline py-3 last-of-type:border-b-0"><summary data-trait="pause" class="relative block cursor-pointer select-none list-none after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-inset-y-1 after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex min-h-6 items-baseline gap-3"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-baseline gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-2 shrink-0 self-center trait-dot"></span><span class="font-display min-w-0 truncate text-row font-bold">Pausing</span></span><span class="font-display w-8 shrink-0 text-right text-body font-extrabold tabular-nums">72<span class="sr-only"> out of 100</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="disclosure-mark shrink-0 self-center text-stone-400"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m6 9.5 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 ml-4 mr-[26px] block h-1.5 overflow-hidden bg-sand"><span data-bar="true" class="block h-full bg-bar-plain " style="width:72%"></span></span></summary><div class="reveal mt-2 pl-4 text-caption leading-relaxed text-stone-500">3 pauses between sentences.</div></details><details class="border-b border-hairline py-3 last-of-type:border-b-0"><summary data-trait="fillers" class="relative block cursor-pointer select-none list-none after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-inset-y-1 after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex min-h-6 items-baseline gap-3"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-baseline gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-2 shrink-0 self-center trait-dot"></span><span class="font-display min-w-0 truncate text-row font-bold">Filler control</span></span><span class="font-display w-8 shrink-0 text-right text-body font-extrabold tabular-nums">55<span class="sr-only"> out of 100</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="disclosure-mark shrink-0 self-center text-stone-400"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m6 9.5 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 ml-4 mr-[26px] block h-1.5 overflow-hidden bg-sand"><span data-bar="true" class="block h-full bg-bar-plain " style="width:55%"></span></span></summary><div class="reveal mt-2 pl-4 text-caption leading-relaxed text-stone-500">All fillers a minute: 3.9 (4 in all, about one every 15 seconds). 0 fillers a minute scores 100; 8 scores 0. Most of them were “um”.<div class="mt-1 text-stone-600">↳ Replace it with silence, not a different word.</div></div></details><details class="border-b border-hairline py-3 last-of-type:border-b-0"><summary data-trait="repairs" class="relative block cursor-pointer select-none list-none after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-inset-y-1 after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex min-h-6 items-baseline gap-3"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-baseline gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-2 shrink-0 self-center trait-dot"></span><span class="font-display min-w-0 truncate text-row font-bold">Sentence restarts</span></span><span class="font-display w-8 shrink-0 text-right text-body font-extrabold tabular-nums">66<span class="sr-only"> out of 100</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="disclosure-mark shrink-0 self-center text-stone-400"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m6 9.5 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 ml-4 mr-[26px] block h-1.5 overflow-hidden bg-sand"><span data-bar="true" class="block h-full bg-bar-plain " style="width:66%"></span></span></summary><div class="reveal mt-2 pl-4 text-caption leading-relaxed text-stone-500">1 sentence restart in 62 seconds. 1 a minute. 0 sentence restarts a minute scores 100; 3 scores 0.<div class="mt-1 text-stone-600">↳ Finish the sentence, then say the better one. A sentence restart makes the listener start over with you.</div></div></details><details class="border-b border-hairline py-3 last-of-type:border-b-0"><summary data-trait="pace" class="relative block cursor-pointer select-none list-none after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-inset-y-1 after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex min-h-6 items-baseline gap-3"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-baseline gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-2 shrink-0 self-center trait-dot"></span><span class="font-display min-w-0 truncate text-row font-bold">Pace</span></span><span class="font-display w-8 shrink-0 text-right text-body font-extrabold tabular-nums">93<span class="sr-only"> out of 100</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="disclosure-mark shrink-0 self-center text-stone-400"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m6 9.5 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 ml-4 mr-[26px] block h-1.5 overflow-hidden bg-sand"><span data-bar="true" class="block h-full bg-bar-plain " style="width:93%"></span></span></summary><div class="reveal mt-2 pl-4 text-caption leading-relaxed text-stone-500">145 words a minute, inside the 130 to 160 zone. Speeding up and slowing down a little adds 10 points.</div></details><details class="border-b border-hairline py-3 last-of-type:border-b-0"><summary data-trait="range" class="relative block cursor-pointer select-none list-none after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-inset-y-1 after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex min-h-6 items-baseline gap-3"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-baseline gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-2 shrink-0 self-center trait-dot"></span><span class="font-display min-w-0 truncate text-row font-bold">Variety</span></span><span class="font-display w-8 shrink-0 text-right text-body font-extrabold tabular-nums">66<span class="sr-only"> out of 100</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="disclosure-mark shrink-0 self-center text-stone-400"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m6 9.5 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 ml-4 mr-[26px] block h-1.5 overflow-hidden bg-sand"><span data-bar="true" class="block h-full bg-bar-plain " style="width:66%"></span></span></summary><div class="reveal mt-2 pl-4 text-caption leading-relaxed text-stone-500">90 different words in every 100 you said. Words you repeat, and words like “really”, “very” and “thing”, cost points.</div></details></div></div></section><section class="mt-7"><h2 class="section-head">Every filler<span class="section-head-count">4</span></h2><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5"><span class="rounded-full bg-stone-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-caption text-ink">um <span class="tabular-nums text-stone-500">0:02</span></span><span class="rounded-full bg-stone-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-caption text-ink">like <span class="tabular-nums text-stone-500">0:07</span></span><span class="rounded-full bg-stone-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-caption text-ink">um <span class="tabular-nums text-stone-500">0:10</span></span><span class="rounded-full bg-stone-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-caption text-ink">you know <span class="tabular-nums text-stone-500">0:15</span></span></div></section><section class="mt-7"><h2 class="section-head">What you said<span class="section-head-count">12 words</span></h2><div aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-caption text-stone-500"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5" data-trait="fillers"><span class="tw-key" data-word-mark="filler"></span>filler</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5" data-trait="range"><span class="tw-key" data-word-mark="vague"></span>vague</span></div><div role="group" aria-label="Transcript. Every word opens what to say instead." class="transcript mt-3"><span role="button" tabindex="0" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="so" class="tw">So</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="the" class="tw">the</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-mark="vague" data-word-key="thing" data-trait="range" class="tw">thing<span class="sr-only">, vague</span></span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="about" class="tw">about</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="habits" class="tw">habits</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="is" class="tw">is</span>, <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-mark="filler" data-word-key="um" data-trait="fillers" class="tw">um<span class="sr-only">, filler</span></span>, <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="they" class="tw">they</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="compound" class="tw">compound</span>. <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="you" class="tw">You</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="do" class="tw">do</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="the" class="tw">the</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="small" class="tw">small</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="version" class="tw">version</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="every" class="tw">every</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="day" class="tw">day</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="and" class="tw">and</span>, <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-mark="filler" data-word-key="like" data-trait="fillers" class="tw">like<span class="sr-only">, filler</span></span>, <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="it" class="tw">it</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="builds" class="tw">builds</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="on" class="tw">on</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="its" class="tw">its</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="own" class="tw">own</span>. <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-mark="filler" data-word-key="um" data-trait="fillers" class="tw">Um<span class="sr-only">, filler</span></span>, <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="the" class="tw">the</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="mistake" class="tw">mistake</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="people" class="tw">people</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="make" class="tw">make</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="is" class="tw">is</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="waiting" class="tw">waiting</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="to" class="tw">to</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="feel" class="tw">feel</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="ready" class="tw">ready</span>. <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-mark="filler" data-word-key="you know" data-trait="fillers" class="tw">You know<span class="sr-only">, filler</span></span>, <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="ready" class="tw">ready</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="is" class="tw">is</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="a" class="tw">a</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="feeling" class="tw">feeling</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="that" class="tw">that</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="shows" class="tw">shows</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="up" class="tw">up</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="after" class="tw">after</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="you" class="tw">you</span> <span role="button" tabindex="-1" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-word-key="start" class="tw">start</span>.</div></section>"`;

exports[`RepResult section="all", the Log's page (#427) > renders exactly as it did at #484 1`] = `"<link rel="preload" as="image" href="/demos-512/demos-onboard-speaking.webp"/><p class="eyebrow mt-5">Your Ethos</p><div class="mt-1 flex items-center gap-3"><span data-ethos-score="true" class="flex items-baseline gap-1 "><span data-score="true" class="font-display text-num-hero font-extrabold tabular-nums"><span>665</span></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap text-body font-normal text-stone-500">/1000</span></span><span class="ml-auto"><span role="img" aria-label="2 of 3 stars" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-start align-middle" style="gap:4px"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-flex earned-lit "><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3.2L14.5 9.16L20.94 9.7L16.04 13.91L17.53 20.2L12 16.85L6.47 20.2L7.96 13.91L3.06 9.7L9.5 9.16z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-flex earned-lit "><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3.2L14.5 9.16L20.94 9.7L16.04 13.91L17.53 20.2L12 16.85L6.47 20.2L7.96 13.91L3.06 9.7L9.5 9.16z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-flex text-stone-400 "><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3.2L14.5 9.16L20.94 9.7L16.04 13.91L17.53 20.2L12 16.85L6.47 20.2L7.96 13.91L3.06 9.7L9.5 9.16z" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"></path></svg></span></span></span></div><p class="font-display text-link font-bold tabular-nums text-sage-700 mt-1"><span aria-hidden="true">▲</span><span class="sr-only">Up</span> 3 since last time</p><div class="mt-7 flex w-full items-start gap-3 text-left"><div class="relative shrink-0"><div class="relative mx-auto shrink-0  " style="width:112px;height:112px" aria-hidden="true"><div class="relative z-[1] h-full w-full "><div class="relative h-full w-full"><img alt="" width="112" height="112" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="demos demos-breath  block h-full w-full" style="color:transparent" src="/demos-512/demos-onboard-speaking.webp"/><svg viewBox="0 0 40 60" class="absolute text-amber" style="left:82%;top:14%;width:12%;height:17%" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"><path class="arc" style="--i:0" d="M 6 18 q 8 12 0 24"></path><path class="arc" style="--i:1" d="M 16 12 q 11 18 0 36"></path><path class="arc" style="--i:2" d="M 26 6 q 14 24 0 48"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 "><div data-speech="" class="relative px-4 py-3.5 font-body font-normal card text-ink text-detail leading-[24px] "><p class="text-balance">Kill ‘um’. 2 of your 4 fillers.</p><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute h-3.5 w-3.5 rotate-45 border-card-edge bg-raised -left-[7px] top-[22px] border-b border-l dark:bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--color-raised),#fff_2%)]"></span></div><p class="mt-2 pl-1 text-caption text-stone-400">AI-generated feedback</p></div></div><section class="mt-7"><h2 class="section-head">Your scores</h2><div class="mt-3"><p data-dimension-headline="true" class="mb-3 text-body text-ink text-pretty">You spoke at a good pace and paused between sentences. Filler control has the most room to grow.</p><div class="card px-4 py-1"><details data-band="strong" class="border-b border-hairline py-3 last-of-type:border-b-0"><summary data-trait="pause" class="relative block cursor-pointer select-none list-none after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-inset-y-1 after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex min-h-6 items-baseline gap-3"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-baseline gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-2 shrink-0 self-center trait-dot"></span><span class="font-display min-w-0 truncate text-row font-bold">Pausing</span></span><span data-band-word="true" class="shrink-0 text-caption font-semibold text-sage-700">Strong</span><span class="font-display w-8 shrink-0 text-right text-body font-extrabold tabular-nums">72<span class="sr-only"> out of 100</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="disclosure-mark shrink-0 self-center text-stone-400"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m6 9.5 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 ml-4 mr-[26px] block h-1.5 overflow-hidden bg-sand"><span data-bar="true" class="block h-full bg-sage-600 " style="width:72%"></span></span></summary><div class="reveal mt-2 pl-4 text-caption leading-relaxed text-stone-500">3 pauses between sentences.</div></details><details data-band="okay" class="border-b border-hairline py-3 last-of-type:border-b-0"><summary data-trait="fillers" class="relative block cursor-pointer select-none list-none after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-inset-y-1 after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex min-h-6 items-baseline gap-3"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-baseline gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-2 shrink-0 self-center trait-dot"></span><span class="font-display min-w-0 truncate text-row font-bold">Filler control</span></span><span data-band-word="true" class="shrink-0 text-caption font-semibold text-stone-500">Okay</span><span class="font-display w-8 shrink-0 text-right text-body font-extrabold tabular-nums">55<span class="sr-only"> out of 100</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="disclosure-mark shrink-0 self-center text-stone-400"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 