ummary><div class="reveal mt-2 pl-4 text-caption leading-relaxed text-stone-500">1 sentence restart in 62 seconds. 1 a minute. 0 sentence restarts a minute scores 100; 3 scores 0.<div class="mt-1 text-stone-600">↳ Finish the sentence, then say the better one. A sentence restart makes the listener start over with you.</div></div></details><details data-band="strong" class="border-b border-hairline py-3 last-of-type:border-b-0"><summary data-trait="pace" class="relative block cursor-pointer select-none list-none after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-inset-y-1 after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex min-h-6 items-baseline gap-3"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-baseline gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-2 shrink-0 self-center trait-dot"></span><span class="font-display min-w-0 truncate text-row font-bold">Pace</span></span><span data-band-word="true" class="shrink-0 text-caption font-semibold text-sage-700">Strong</span><span class="font-display w-8 shrink-0 text-right text-body font-extrabold tabular-nums">93<span class="sr-only"> out of 100</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="disclosure-mark shrink-0 self-center text-stone-400"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m6 9.5 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 ml-4 mr-[26px] block h-1.5 overflow-hidden bg-sand"><span data-bar="true" class="block h-full bg-sage-600 " style="width:93%"></span></span></summary><div class="reveal mt-2 pl-4 text-caption leading-relaxed text-stone-500">145 words a minute, inside the 130 to 160 zone. Speeding up and slowing down a little adds 10 points.</div></details><details data-band="okay" class="border-b border-hairline py-3 last-of-type:border-b-0"><summary data-trait="range" class="relative block cursor-pointer select-none li